<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-12T13:00:27.470Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 13:00:27 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi forces have intensified missile and drone attacks on Saudi targets, while Saudi Arabia and its coalition have intercepted many of these weapons and reported debris falling near Mecca. The Houthis deny that they are targeting Mecca, and both sides claim heavy losses from their exchanges of attacks in Yemen. Italy noted that EU nations have not committed to Red Sea security and the EU faces criticism for inaction. US Republicans blocked efforts to impeach Defence Secretary Pete Hegseth over the Iran war. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/10/trump-vows-to-back-pete-hegseth-as-republican-lawmaker-pushes-impeachment-vote&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/10/world/middleeast/syria-weighs-sending-troops-to-aid-saudi-war-with-houthis.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE1abWpBN3RhOHFkOXlKckNoWXI0SUlSMFVNM1dPcHgtYmgtNFA2WXpTU1VMTk1FQXlhSzE1aDloY0U2WHVqbGg5Xw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxQSEdmMVduSHJxWEd1UWVkOUtrcF91S3VfSnI0MzlnTjh6NFdHOFNpSTBXU1JpdFk3NHdORlNsck91bFEyNUNLMHdoT1hFZmlqTGdaUDU2c2ZkeXE0Zl82cURaQXZxTS1IMmxqS3FNUEVNU1FRU1NQU01EQkxzNkN0YUhWek1qRm9ZYkNUS1FrWUIyTmFaUFFkTERqZER3UUx6cEN3VVdWNG56R19zSFkzRWphVUl1Z3I1eHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxPWnhBOXVyQlRla2RBb3ItSUlMLTFZOGhrY2R6SHRHQl9LdFc1aWlBZjJxWVdORW85YnhMMUFoaktjdmR0QmhLeGxtVDJTbnpVV21VUERrYlpNZzB6clJQejdVSl9Tc1duM2lqZURQZTlOWVExUWlyNnFpZGpHUlFVR0tEUkFzVE5